%description:
An Ethernet PDU session needs an anchor UPF with an Ethernet session bridge (hasEthernetBridge):
the UPF rejects the session's establishment without one.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.upf.hasEthernetBridge = false
*.ue[*].sessionType = "Ethernet"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
UserPlaneNodeControl: NrSessionTestNetwork.upf anchors an Ethernet session, but has no Ethernet session bridge (see its hasEthernetBridge parameter)
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
